						</tr><tr>
							<td id="article_byline">
								by <b>Rodolfo La Maestra</b> on <b>November 24, 2009</b>
							</td><td id="article_category">
								Categories: <b><a href="/category.php?id=11&category=Technology">Technology</a></b>
